<title>POLAND: Agros plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Agros plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Agros SA plans no dividend for 1996 and wants to allocate most of its 31.9-million-zloty net profit for reserve capital, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Agros said it wanted to earmark 28.7 million zlotys for reserve capital and that the final decision on the allocation would be made at the company's general shareholders' meeting on June 28.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
